WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.420 --> 01:42.340
[Episode 18]

02:23.560 --> 02:24.380
Si'er?

02:38.030 --> 02:38.980
It sees so far.

02:40.280 --> 02:41.380
What magic instrument is this?

02:43.000 --> 02:43.980
Telescope.

02:45.560 --> 02:46.340
Telescope?

02:47.800 --> 02:49.690
I've only heard
of the Spellreveal Mirror.

02:50.470 --> 02:51.940
Whose magic instrument is this?

02:58.960 --> 02:59.730
Mine.

03:02.560 --> 03:03.340
Yours?

03:07.430 --> 03:08.380
Let me have a look.

03:09.150 --> 03:10.220
One more look.

03:13.870 --> 03:14.690
Bumpkin.

03:15.310 --> 03:16.130
It's like the Farglass.

03:19.840 --> 03:21.130
How did you know

03:21.280 --> 03:22.940
they'd fight here today?

03:23.630 --> 03:25.940
I set it up in secret.

03:25.960 --> 03:26.660
Is that so?

03:26.910 --> 03:29.450
Jiang Si'er knows Ao Yi well.

03:29.470 --> 03:31.540
She'll surely recognize him.

03:32.240 --> 03:35.130
And the Mermaid Clan just fell out

03:35.150 --> 03:37.010
with the Dragon Clan.

03:37.030 --> 03:37.940
Ao Yi

03:38.190 --> 03:40.130
is sure to be her first target.

03:40.960 --> 03:42.780
So, their fight today

03:42.800 --> 03:44.500
was part of your plan, too?

03:44.910 --> 03:45.940
Of course.

03:46.360 --> 03:48.570
I just used Jiang Si'er

03:48.710 --> 03:50.570
to test Ao Yi's true strength.

03:50.800 --> 03:53.170
Because all my later plans

03:53.190 --> 03:55.100
depend on a true read

03:55.150 --> 03:56.540
of Ao Yi's strength.

03:56.560 --> 03:57.660
So cautious, huh?

03:57.750 --> 03:59.010
How's the evaluation?

04:01.360 --> 04:02.100
Zero points.

04:03.120 --> 04:03.940
Pathetic.

04:08.750 --> 04:09.540
What?

04:11.520 --> 04:12.380
What's that?

04:14.680 --> 04:15.450
Mine.

04:18.750 --> 04:19.290
This...

04:21.070 --> 04:22.020
Just a habit, you see.

04:26.160 --> 04:27.100
Mine.

04:27.120 --> 04:27.980
I know, I know.

04:30.430 --> 04:31.340
It's mine.

04:31.360 --> 04:32.140
Are you crazy?

04:32.800 --> 04:33.610
You can't have it.

04:35.240 --> 04:36.610
Our clan had hoped

04:36.630 --> 04:38.540
for your return to the East Sea,

04:38.870 --> 04:40.410
and we'd support you to replace Ao Jia.

04:41.190 --> 04:43.140
But you're so weak.

04:43.950 --> 04:45.410
How can you save the Dragon Clan?

04:47.560 --> 04:48.340
I...

04:48.390 --> 04:50.140
What did you learn in the Mortal Realm?

04:50.390 --> 04:50.730
I...

04:50.750 --> 04:51.370
Your martial arts,

04:51.750 --> 04:52.540
magical power,

04:52.680 --> 04:53.460
and quick wit

04:53.750 --> 04:55.540
are all a mess.

04:58.360 --> 04:59.140
No.

04:59.950 --> 05:00.460
I...

05:00.480 --> 05:01.490
I was wrong.

05:01.920 --> 05:03.580
I should not have expected more.

05:05.240 --> 05:05.930
You're that spoiled little dragon

05:05.950 --> 05:07.730
from the East Sea.

05:08.430 --> 05:09.610
You'll never grow up.

05:10.830 --> 05:12.340
You should go back to the East Sea.

05:13.000 --> 05:14.140
Outside the East Sea,

05:14.510 --> 05:16.220
you can't survive at all.

05:17.950 --> 05:19.490
Are you here to take me back?

05:21.360 --> 05:22.140
Take you back?

05:25.750 --> 05:27.170
You can still return to the East Sea.

05:27.950 --> 05:29.140
Yet our clan

05:30.240 --> 05:31.730
has no home left.

05:35.040 --> 05:36.140
What happened?

05:38.040 --> 05:39.780
I broke off the engagement
with your brother.

05:40.310 --> 05:41.900
It enraged the Dragon Clan.

05:43.480 --> 05:46.020
The Mermaid Clan has no place
in the East Sea.

05:46.750 --> 05:47.980
We can never go back.

05:56.480 --> 05:58.930
I heard Changgeng the Great is
at Ascendance Sect.

05:59.270 --> 06:01.490
I wanted to bring my clan
to seek his help.

06:02.510 --> 06:04.540
But I don't know where he is now.

06:05.040 --> 06:06.410
Once I master the Seizing Sect's arts,

06:07.430 --> 06:08.730
I can take you back too.

06:13.040 --> 06:13.810
You?

06:17.120 --> 06:20.540
I've never seen a dragon as weak as you.

06:25.510 --> 06:26.930
Don't bully Little Uncle!

06:28.830 --> 06:30.140
Don't bully Little Uncle!

06:30.430 --> 06:31.490
You bold demoness!

06:31.600 --> 06:33.220
How dare you strike
a Seizing Sect disciple!

06:35.870 --> 06:37.850
Zhao Gongming of Seizing Sect
is on this mountain.

06:37.870 --> 06:39.610
With one shout, he'll appear!

06:39.680 --> 06:41.050
Is it time for my entrance?

06:41.070 --> 06:42.290
Not yet. Don't rush.

06:42.360 --> 06:43.930
No, she's calling my name.

06:43.950 --> 06:45.370
Hold on. Don't rush.

06:45.390 --> 06:46.370
Show me. Let me see.

06:46.830 --> 06:47.370
Mine.

06:47.390 --> 06:48.140
I know. I...

06:49.270 --> 06:51.020
This is the Human Clan
for you to learn from?

06:58.360 --> 06:59.900
Little Uncle, are you all right?

07:01.390 --> 07:03.810
I wanted to join Seizing Sect
and study the Way,

07:03.830 --> 07:04.930
so I could revive...

07:06.680 --> 07:07.580
Was I

07:08.630 --> 07:10.370
being too naive?

07:10.390 --> 07:11.780
What nonsense.

07:11.800 --> 07:13.100
You're not weak at all.

07:13.510 --> 07:15.700
Are people born strong?

07:15.720 --> 07:16.700
Even a sage

07:16.720 --> 07:18.410
must learn step by step.

07:22.120 --> 07:23.340
But I can't do anything.

07:25.430 --> 07:26.540
That only means

07:26.560 --> 07:28.140
you can learn anything.

07:29.310 --> 07:30.850
Our mentor may be a bit lacking,

07:30.870 --> 07:32.700
but he is a Seizing Sect deity.

07:32.870 --> 07:34.020
As long as you're willing to learn,

07:34.190 --> 07:35.700
you'll surely grow strong.

07:35.800 --> 07:37.900
Besides, you're not fully healed yet.

07:37.920 --> 07:39.730
Losing is only natural.

07:40.040 --> 07:42.100
I'll brew you more medicine later.

07:45.040 --> 07:45.810
Come on.

07:46.390 --> 07:47.290
It really is your turn.

07:47.310 --> 07:48.730
Here's your chance. Go.

07:52.000 --> 07:52.490
It's mine.

07:53.240 --> 07:53.660
Thank you.

07:56.070 --> 07:56.930
It's mine!

08:03.000 --> 08:04.490
Uncle Zhao, perfect timing.

08:04.510 --> 08:06.340
Someone tried to bully Little Uncle.

08:08.870 --> 08:10.340
Who is so bold

08:10.560 --> 08:12.020
as to bully Seizing Sect members?

08:12.040 --> 08:12.610
Exactly!

08:12.630 --> 08:13.250
Go.

08:13.510 --> 08:14.410
Lead the way, quickly.

08:14.560 --> 08:15.220
I'll catch up with her.

08:15.240 --> 08:16.340
I'll extort her to death.

08:16.360 --> 08:16.700
Little Uncle.

08:17.190 --> 08:17.850
I'll extort her to death.

08:17.870 --> 08:18.580
Little Uncle.

08:19.000 --> 08:20.220
I just got a telescope. Take a look.

08:20.480 --> 08:21.490
It seems like the Farglass.

08:21.510 --> 08:22.370
What telescope?

08:53.440 --> 08:54.300
Bai Shi?

08:54.360 --> 08:56.130
Bai Shi? It's not Bear Island.

08:56.750 --> 08:57.610
Right,

08:58.150 --> 08:58.980
Ke Le'er?

09:00.750 --> 09:01.730
I'm Li Changshou.

09:01.750 --> 09:04.530
Greetings, Ao Yi,
Second Prince of the East Sea.

09:05.080 --> 09:06.460
What do you want?

09:07.000 --> 09:08.340
Though I have no magical power now...

09:08.360 --> 09:09.010
Enough.

09:09.150 --> 09:10.420
I know you have no magical power.

09:10.440 --> 09:12.580
I saw your fight just now.

09:12.870 --> 09:13.980
You saw it?

09:14.080 --> 09:15.250
I had thought

09:15.270 --> 09:16.700
you might last two rounds

09:16.720 --> 09:19.850
and impress Jiang Si'er.

09:19.870 --> 09:20.580
You...

09:21.120 --> 09:21.890
Enough.

09:22.150 --> 09:23.820
As you are, you can't fell a hen.

09:23.840 --> 09:25.010
Go on. Take a rest.

09:32.120 --> 09:32.980
If I were in Dragon Palace,

09:33.000 --> 09:34.420
I'd defeat you with ease.

09:35.440 --> 09:36.130
Enough.

09:36.600 --> 09:37.980
When the two of us spar,

09:38.320 --> 09:40.770
winning is easy; losing is hard.

09:41.790 --> 09:43.130
If it were not for me...

09:45.320 --> 09:46.420
I've already

09:46.600 --> 09:47.490
broken free of my bonds,

09:47.510 --> 09:48.420
fulfilled Dragon's Prophecy,

09:48.440 --> 09:49.340
and achieved dragon transformation.

09:49.600 --> 09:50.460
But who could have known...

09:55.030 --> 09:55.820
Well.

09:57.150 --> 09:58.530
Do you remember what happened

09:59.480 --> 10:00.340
after the dragon transformation?

10:00.870 --> 10:01.770
After the dragon transformation?

10:02.390 --> 10:03.940
I just remember

10:04.080 --> 10:05.580
Hua died right in front of me.

10:05.600 --> 10:06.850
I felt a surge

10:06.960 --> 10:09.610
of uncontrollable power rise inside me.

10:10.200 --> 10:11.610
Then I lost consciousness.

10:11.750 --> 10:13.460
Later, I woke up

10:13.790 --> 10:14.530
on Turtle Island.

10:14.550 --> 10:15.770
Senior Yuan Ze saved me.

10:18.750 --> 10:20.010
You don't remember what happened

10:20.440 --> 10:21.650
after the dragon transformation?

10:22.480 --> 10:23.460
No.

10:25.440 --> 10:26.650
But I remember

10:26.670 --> 10:28.340
this one person

10:28.670 --> 10:29.530
kept touching me

10:29.630 --> 10:30.580
all over.

10:31.790 --> 10:32.730
The Mortal Realm is terrifying.

10:32.790 --> 10:34.010
It's full of shameless rogues.

10:38.000 --> 10:38.730
Yes.

10:39.080 --> 10:40.530
Yes, there are plenty of rogues.

10:41.360 --> 10:42.130
There's another matter.

10:43.000 --> 10:44.130
I lost the power
of dragon transformation.

10:45.030 --> 10:45.940
Power of dragon transformation?

10:48.670 --> 10:49.460
Look.

10:54.320 --> 10:55.100
What's wrong?

10:55.790 --> 10:56.700
Your skin looks fine.

10:56.720 --> 10:57.580
That's not the point!

10:59.600 --> 11:00.340
I had a mark right here.

11:00.360 --> 11:01.580
That was my Dragon's Prophecy.

11:01.630 --> 11:02.370
Now, it's gone.

11:02.510 --> 11:03.370
Dragon's Prophecy?

11:07.240 --> 11:08.730
Why is this so hard to wash off?

11:17.030 --> 11:18.530
Your Dragon's Prophecy is gone?

11:19.720 --> 11:20.250
No, that thing

11:20.270 --> 11:21.100
came off so easily?

11:21.120 --> 11:21.700
Impossible.

11:22.790 --> 11:23.610
What came off?

11:24.750 --> 11:26.610
No, I mean, could it be

11:26.670 --> 11:28.010
that it's just less visible now?

11:31.320 --> 11:32.220
What are you doing?

11:32.870 --> 11:34.420
I've accepted my Fated Mandate.

11:34.630 --> 11:36.340
No, you can't accept this.

11:36.360 --> 11:37.220
Could it be

11:37.240 --> 11:38.180
transferred somewhere else?

11:39.320 --> 11:39.700
Hurry!

11:39.720 --> 11:40.460
It didn't transfer.

11:40.480 --> 11:40.850
Let me see.

11:40.870 --> 11:41.700
I've made up my mind.

11:41.910 --> 11:42.770
The Dragon's Prophecy

11:43.080 --> 11:43.940
is a curse to me.

11:44.240 --> 11:44.820
Now, it's gone.

11:44.840 --> 11:46.010
I can finally shed my dragon identity.

11:47.000 --> 11:47.610
I've made my choice.

11:47.870 --> 11:49.100
I will re-cultivate
the Human Clan's Way.

11:49.550 --> 11:50.730
This is my true Fated Mandate.

11:50.790 --> 11:52.180
That was your lifeline!

11:52.320 --> 11:53.650
If it's gone, what am I to do?

11:55.870 --> 11:56.820
What did you just say?

11:56.910 --> 11:57.700
I said

11:58.150 --> 11:59.370
I've made up my mind

11:59.720 --> 12:01.130
to study the Human Clan's spells.

12:01.200 --> 12:03.250
That is my true Fated Mandate.

12:04.200 --> 12:05.010
Human Clan's spells?

12:07.080 --> 12:07.980
Exactly.

12:09.750 --> 12:11.700
Even without the Dragon's Prophecy,

12:12.320 --> 12:14.250
you can still restore your strength.

12:15.750 --> 12:17.180
What you lack is spiritual power.

12:17.200 --> 12:18.980
If I can replenish your spiritual power,

12:19.000 --> 12:20.460
that's readily...

12:21.440 --> 12:22.420
Your Highness.

12:22.840 --> 12:23.610
Your Highness.

12:24.720 --> 12:25.770
I have a plan

12:26.080 --> 12:28.770
to greatly boost your strength
in no time.

12:29.600 --> 12:30.300
That impressive?

12:30.320 --> 12:31.460
But you must trust me.

12:33.480 --> 12:36.340
I've never seen a dragon as weak as you.

12:37.120 --> 12:38.460
Tell me. What should I do?

13:18.840 --> 13:20.980
How long ago was the last time

13:21.550 --> 13:23.180
we sat drinking together,

13:25.080 --> 13:25.850
Senior?

13:26.840 --> 13:28.250
I think it was

13:28.790 --> 13:31.770
when my power just edged past yours.

13:34.750 --> 13:36.060
That was so long ago.

13:37.240 --> 13:38.250
I can barely remember.

13:49.200 --> 13:50.250
Junior Kuai Si,

13:51.870 --> 13:52.650
I know

13:53.240 --> 13:55.460
you look down on me.

13:55.720 --> 13:57.770
You think I'm completely useless.

13:58.360 --> 14:01.010
But whether you see me
as a bird in the sky,

14:01.030 --> 14:02.370
a fish in the water,

14:02.440 --> 14:05.060
or a sheep grazing in a field,

14:06.320 --> 14:07.340
I don't care.

14:08.630 --> 14:11.460
But if you move against my disciples,

14:13.150 --> 14:15.130
I will fight you to the death.

14:24.030 --> 14:25.530
Word has spread
that the immortal seeding

14:26.240 --> 14:29.180
who survived
the Divine-Demon Tribulation

14:29.630 --> 14:30.980
is called Changgeng,

14:32.000 --> 14:34.130
yet no one has ever truly seen him.

14:36.120 --> 14:37.820
Senior, have you thought

14:39.320 --> 14:40.100
that perhaps

14:41.270 --> 14:42.980
this person isn't Changgeng?

14:43.790 --> 14:45.010
Maybe it's someone

14:46.200 --> 14:48.130
we all know.

14:53.120 --> 14:54.420
Such as...?

14:55.910 --> 14:57.370
Your mentor

14:58.030 --> 14:59.730
and Senior Wan Jiangyu

15:01.120 --> 15:03.530
headed to the South Sea, right?

15:21.240 --> 15:22.340
Time has passed.

15:23.750 --> 15:24.770
There's been no word from them.

15:27.360 --> 15:28.370
It couldn't be her.

15:31.080 --> 15:32.130
What if

15:32.550 --> 15:34.460
I have a clue?

15:57.120 --> 15:57.900
Mentor,

15:59.760 --> 16:01.010
you want me

16:02.120 --> 16:03.370
to attempt the formation trial?

16:03.750 --> 16:04.580
Of course.

16:05.030 --> 16:07.220
You won a great victory yesterday.

16:07.240 --> 16:09.650
Today, you must press the advantage.

16:12.360 --> 16:13.370
Do you truly think so?

16:15.000 --> 16:15.770
Changshou,

16:16.270 --> 16:19.730
our division has not shone in years.

16:19.750 --> 16:21.580
Grandlord praised you yesterday.

16:22.550 --> 16:23.530
Changshou,

16:24.270 --> 16:25.340
do you feel that today,

16:25.360 --> 16:26.940
I seem different too?

16:29.120 --> 16:29.980
How so?

16:31.360 --> 16:33.370
Don't you see my eyes are bright,

16:33.390 --> 16:34.420
and my complexion looks better?

16:34.440 --> 16:35.490
Most of all,

16:35.510 --> 16:38.130
I stand straighter.

16:40.910 --> 16:41.730
I don't see it.

16:44.240 --> 16:46.130
What if I fail the formation trial?

16:46.240 --> 16:47.300
Then so be it.

16:47.790 --> 16:50.530
We've been in 800th place

16:51.360 --> 16:53.980
in the Sect Competition for years.

16:56.080 --> 16:57.980
Come on, little fish, bite.

16:58.000 --> 17:00.010
After all morning, nothing.

17:01.840 --> 17:02.610
Mentor.

17:03.080 --> 17:04.330
Please think of a way yourself.

17:05.440 --> 17:06.530
No, no, Changshou.

17:07.480 --> 17:08.090
Changshou.

17:08.200 --> 17:08.900
I...

17:12.200 --> 17:12.980
Mentor.

17:15.270 --> 17:16.420
I still think

17:17.510 --> 17:19.290
you're not yourself today.

17:22.070 --> 17:22.900
Not myself?

17:22.920 --> 17:24.380
I'm the same as ever.

17:24.400 --> 17:25.140
Are you?

17:25.640 --> 17:26.380
I am.

17:26.400 --> 17:27.810
Then, what if I tell you

17:28.000 --> 17:29.730
I won't do the formation trial?

17:32.480 --> 17:33.900
If you don't,

17:33.920 --> 17:35.330
I'll expel you from the division.

17:39.440 --> 17:40.220
Mentor,

17:42.350 --> 17:43.530
confess honestly.

17:44.000 --> 17:46.730
Who did you see last night?
Where did you go?

17:54.160 --> 17:54.940
No.

17:55.720 --> 17:57.770
I'm the Lord of Jade Division.

17:57.920 --> 17:59.010
I am your mentor.

17:59.070 --> 18:00.810
I go wherever I please.

18:00.830 --> 18:02.290
I see whomever I wish.

18:05.830 --> 18:06.700
Mentor.

18:08.720 --> 18:10.140
When you were out in the world,

18:10.160 --> 18:10.860
did I ever question you?

18:10.880 --> 18:11.570
Did I ever scold you?

18:11.590 --> 18:12.730
Did I ever interfere?

18:14.550 --> 18:15.330
Mentor.

18:16.160 --> 18:17.980
You keep calling me Mentor.

18:18.000 --> 18:19.050
You are my disciple.

18:19.070 --> 18:21.010
Is one task too much
to ask of my disciple?

18:21.030 --> 18:23.530
I want everyone
to respect Jade Division.

18:23.550 --> 18:24.530
Is that so difficult?

18:25.030 --> 18:25.980
If you refuse me,

18:26.000 --> 18:27.180
don't call me Mentor anymore.

18:45.590 --> 18:46.380
Yesterday...

18:50.030 --> 18:51.620
Yesterday, I went to see Kuai Si.

18:53.400 --> 18:54.530
What did he say to you?

18:54.920 --> 18:55.980
What could he say?

18:57.960 --> 18:59.140
He humiliated me, of course.

19:00.960 --> 19:02.420
He called me a failure as a teacher,

19:03.920 --> 19:06.490
saying Jade Division is worthless,

19:07.960 --> 19:10.900
and we don't belong in Ascendance Sect.

19:16.640 --> 19:18.330
You know what he's like.

19:18.550 --> 19:20.420
He's been saying that for years.

19:20.480 --> 19:21.490
It's fine.

19:22.350 --> 19:23.140
Yes.

19:26.350 --> 19:28.090
He's humiliated me all these years.

19:30.240 --> 19:32.010
I thought those words

19:32.030 --> 19:33.220
wouldn't faze me.

19:35.590 --> 19:37.570
But when he actually said them,

19:39.880 --> 19:41.180
each and every word

19:41.200 --> 19:42.940
was like a knife,

19:45.480 --> 19:47.010
stabbing my heart.

19:49.070 --> 19:49.940
It hurts.

20:01.200 --> 20:01.980
Changshou.

20:03.640 --> 20:04.420
My good disciple.

20:05.720 --> 20:06.570
All these years,

20:06.590 --> 20:10.330
I've never asked you for anything.

20:12.350 --> 20:13.140
Never.

20:14.750 --> 20:16.290
Today, I beg you.

20:17.270 --> 20:19.530
Please let our division

20:20.830 --> 20:22.420
earn some respect for once.

20:25.440 --> 20:26.420
I beg you.

20:53.750 --> 20:54.530
Fine.

20:55.440 --> 20:57.530
Changshou, I knew you'd understand.

20:57.550 --> 20:59.460
Mentor, just stay here quietly.

20:59.480 --> 21:00.420
Don't go anywhere.

21:03.000 --> 21:04.290
Wait till I return defeated.

21:04.480 --> 21:05.980
Then I'll undo the Transformation Art.

21:06.830 --> 21:07.620
Good.

21:08.480 --> 21:09.250
Changshou.

21:11.160 --> 21:11.940
Changshou.

21:14.270 --> 21:14.860
It's settled now.

21:15.400 --> 21:16.770
A bit too settled.

21:18.590 --> 21:19.810
It looks like a fish took the bait.

21:23.030 --> 21:24.290
The Formation Assembly begins.

21:25.110 --> 21:26.330
Disciples of all sects,

21:26.480 --> 21:27.940
please enter in an orderly manner.

21:28.300 --> 21:32.170
[Hall of Mystic Truth]
Great!

21:45.790 --> 21:47.570
Where's Mentor? Have you seen Mentor?

21:48.110 --> 21:48.940
He hasn't come?

21:49.160 --> 21:51.010
Has he come? I couldn't find him.

21:58.270 --> 21:59.730
What are we waiting for, Uncle?

22:00.270 --> 22:01.330
Wait...

22:02.440 --> 22:02.860
Well.

22:03.070 --> 22:03.810
Let's wait and see.

22:06.680 --> 22:07.900
Don't worry, Little Uncle.

22:07.920 --> 22:09.570
If she shows up again tonight,

22:09.960 --> 22:11.900
our Seizing Sect can deal with her.

22:13.400 --> 22:13.900
Okay.

22:21.270 --> 22:22.090
Isn't she...

22:25.160 --> 22:26.570
The Mermaid Clan's Pearl Elites

22:26.590 --> 22:28.010
are here for the Formation Assembly.

22:32.440 --> 22:33.050
Let's begin.

22:39.270 --> 22:39.980
Mentor,

22:40.640 --> 22:42.140
why are a few missing?

22:42.240 --> 22:43.330
Where is Aunt Jiu Jiu?

22:44.070 --> 22:44.860
She got drunk

22:45.200 --> 22:46.460
and caused trouble yesterday.

22:46.680 --> 22:48.050
It nearly dragged Ascendance Sect

22:48.070 --> 22:49.380
into a clash with Seizing Sect,

22:49.790 --> 22:52.140
so Mentor sent her on mountain patrol.

22:52.750 --> 22:53.490
Mountain patrol?

22:54.030 --> 22:57.250
♪Jiu Jiu patrols the hills today♪

22:58.440 --> 23:02.660
♪I roam these mountains all the way♪

23:19.070 --> 23:19.940
What is it, Aunt?

23:20.270 --> 23:21.250
Feeling down?

23:21.750 --> 23:22.730
No.

23:24.400 --> 23:26.620
What? You know I am leaving,

23:26.960 --> 23:27.860
and you're missing me already?

23:28.070 --> 23:29.660
Of course.

23:29.680 --> 23:30.900
Without you here,

23:30.920 --> 23:31.860
I will feel unsafe.

23:31.880 --> 23:32.980
It is just mountain patrol.

23:33.000 --> 23:34.180
I will be back tomorrow.

23:34.510 --> 23:35.050
Here.

23:36.110 --> 23:37.730
A gift from me.

23:38.480 --> 23:40.860
This treasure may only be taken out

23:40.880 --> 23:42.380
when no one else is around.

23:43.270 --> 23:43.860
Have a taste.

23:44.070 --> 23:45.180
Such a lovely aroma.

23:47.830 --> 23:48.380
How is it?

23:48.590 --> 23:49.380
Truly fine wine.

23:49.790 --> 23:51.900
You're the best.

23:52.000 --> 23:52.730
Thank you.

23:53.830 --> 23:54.460
What's this?

23:54.830 --> 23:55.490
This is

23:55.510 --> 23:56.220
a little trinket

23:56.240 --> 23:58.090
I made in my spare time.

23:58.270 --> 23:59.420
It's called Sensing Stone.

23:59.880 --> 24:00.660
Sensing Stone?

24:01.000 --> 24:01.620
What does it do?

24:01.640 --> 24:03.530
It monitors the surroundings

24:03.550 --> 24:04.940
for any other spiritual sense.

24:04.960 --> 24:07.220
See? It's light cyan now.

24:07.240 --> 24:08.620
If it turns a darker shade,

24:08.830 --> 24:11.010
there's a spiritual sense nearby.

24:11.030 --> 24:12.220
For detecting dried corpses?

24:12.750 --> 24:14.010
For detecting spiritual sense.

24:14.310 --> 24:14.530
For detecting spiritual sense.

24:14.550 --> 24:15.220
Oh, spiritual sense.

24:15.590 --> 24:16.770
This is interesting

24:16.790 --> 24:17.770
and rather pretty.

24:20.440 --> 24:21.810
Grandlord has never sent anyone
on mountain patrol as punishment.

24:22.310 --> 24:23.620
Punishing you this way

24:24.030 --> 24:25.330
must have a deeper purpose.

24:25.920 --> 24:27.420
Perhaps he fears something.

24:28.400 --> 24:29.090
Anyway, Aunt,

24:29.110 --> 24:30.290
keep that stone on you.

24:30.750 --> 24:31.620
Be careful in all things.

24:33.440 --> 24:36.290
Are you worried about me?

24:37.030 --> 24:39.290
I'm quite strong.

24:39.310 --> 24:40.290
I can tell.

24:41.350 --> 24:42.660
It's just mountain patrol.

24:42.680 --> 24:43.530
I'll be back soon.

24:49.240 --> 24:50.980
This is the Ascendance Sect.

24:51.310 --> 24:54.050
Let me see who dares cause trouble here.

24:54.680 --> 24:56.050
Lingli, you're so heavy.

24:56.240 --> 24:58.050
Lingli, you've gained weight again.

24:58.070 --> 24:58.940
Shut up.

24:59.200 --> 25:00.490
When do we begin?

25:00.790 --> 25:02.010
Have you found our Grandlord yet?

25:02.440 --> 25:03.380
Almost. Almost.

25:13.000 --> 25:13.900
This pearl

25:14.200 --> 25:16.330
is forged by the Elucidating Sect.

25:16.590 --> 25:19.050
Anyone with an intact foundation

25:19.110 --> 25:20.980
can get millennium spiritual power
from this.

25:21.000 --> 25:22.530
Whoever finds this pearl

25:22.550 --> 25:23.900
will pass the formation

25:24.270 --> 25:26.420
and get the pearl.

25:26.510 --> 25:28.290
Who'd want that treasure? Honestly.

25:28.510 --> 25:30.980
All the beings in the world.

25:31.000 --> 25:32.050
Rise!

25:35.720 --> 25:36.570
Not bad.

25:39.830 --> 25:40.620
Who'll try

25:41.550 --> 25:43.180
the formation trial first?

25:47.640 --> 25:48.380
Mentor.

25:53.960 --> 25:56.420
I'm Youqin Xuanya
of Skyrend Division, Ascendance Sect.

25:56.440 --> 25:57.490
I request entry to the formation.

25:58.000 --> 25:58.770
Okay.

26:01.960 --> 26:02.700
Go ahead.

26:29.310 --> 26:30.420
I see.

26:30.720 --> 26:33.620
The Elucidating Sect's formation
is truly profound.

26:38.720 --> 26:39.660
Who else

26:40.110 --> 26:41.250
dares to enter the picture?

26:43.480 --> 26:43.940
Forget it.

26:44.510 --> 26:45.530
Please, Junior.

26:46.640 --> 26:47.380
Tomorrow,

26:47.510 --> 26:49.980
you must challenge
Cloudlink Hermit's formation.

26:51.110 --> 26:51.810
I...

26:52.000 --> 26:53.660
Don't you want to recover your strength?

26:53.920 --> 26:54.980
I do,

26:55.200 --> 26:55.620
but...

26:55.640 --> 26:57.940
The reason you have
no power now is

26:59.000 --> 27:00.660
that an old rogue

27:00.720 --> 27:02.420
stripped away all your spiritual power.

27:02.440 --> 27:04.010
If you can just replenish
your spiritual power,

27:04.030 --> 27:05.490
you'll at least recover

27:05.590 --> 27:07.050
to the level you had at Dragon Palace.

27:07.070 --> 27:07.980
That makes sense.

27:09.200 --> 27:10.460
But what does my formation trial

27:10.480 --> 27:11.290
have to do with my spiritual power?

27:12.400 --> 27:13.620
Don't worry about that.

27:15.750 --> 27:16.530
Leave it to me.

27:18.640 --> 27:19.620
I have a way.

27:24.880 --> 27:25.530
I'll do it.

27:28.310 --> 27:29.250
Are you crazy?

27:29.440 --> 27:30.420
Senior said

27:30.640 --> 27:31.810
that Turtle Island disciples can lose,

27:31.830 --> 27:32.620
but they can't back down.

27:32.640 --> 27:33.420
Right, Senior?

27:35.350 --> 27:36.010
Well said.

27:36.030 --> 27:36.620
Come on.

27:36.920 --> 27:37.730
I'll help you.

27:38.070 --> 27:38.810
Thanks, Senior.

27:39.310 --> 27:40.620
Right, right. We can back down...

27:41.440 --> 27:43.050
We can lose, but not back down.

27:43.070 --> 27:43.530
Go on.

27:43.830 --> 27:45.090
Then why aren't you two going?

27:46.510 --> 27:47.460
I'm not feeling well.

27:47.480 --> 27:48.810
Besides, I'm not the one going.

27:49.160 --> 27:50.090
I'm out of weapons.

27:50.440 --> 27:51.730
Yes, yes.

27:51.830 --> 27:52.460
Senior,

27:52.960 --> 27:53.810
I'll go first.

27:54.160 --> 27:54.810
Watch out for safety.

27:55.000 --> 27:55.730
Nonsense.

27:55.750 --> 27:56.570
Watch out for danger!

27:57.830 --> 27:58.810
I'm a disciple of Turtle Island,

27:59.440 --> 28:00.290
here to attempt the formation trial.

28:00.440 --> 28:01.220
Wait.

28:02.070 --> 28:03.220
I'm Hanzhi, disciple of Turtle Island,

28:03.240 --> 28:04.180
here to enter the formation as well.

28:04.510 --> 28:05.050
Girl.

28:05.160 --> 28:06.620
Learn from Turtle Island.

28:07.640 --> 28:08.460
Good, good.

28:08.720 --> 28:09.090
Learn.

28:17.550 --> 28:18.730
Who else

28:19.400 --> 28:21.490
wants to test their mettle
in the formation trial?

28:26.440 --> 28:27.660
Anyway, I dare not go.

28:27.720 --> 28:28.460
I'm not going either.

28:29.640 --> 28:30.380
Senior,

28:30.440 --> 28:32.330
who do you think will go first?

28:32.350 --> 28:34.770
Mistveil or Griefbane?

28:35.200 --> 28:35.900
Senior, you...

28:40.750 --> 28:42.380
I'm Li Changshou of Jade Division.

28:42.750 --> 28:43.940
I request to enter the array.

28:45.270 --> 28:45.860
Good.

28:52.920 --> 28:53.420
Go on.

29:01.200 --> 29:02.530
Little rascal, be careful.

29:02.830 --> 29:03.700
Rest easy, Yunxiao.

29:06.000 --> 29:06.810
Who else?

29:07.880 --> 29:09.290
Someone else went in.

29:09.680 --> 29:10.700
Is it our Grandlord?

29:10.830 --> 29:12.140
I don't know.

29:12.350 --> 29:13.330
I can't see his face.

29:13.350 --> 29:14.730
I don't know who it is.

29:15.640 --> 29:17.460
A Jade disciple went in.

29:18.270 --> 29:19.660
Why are we still standing here?

29:19.680 --> 29:20.460
Yeah.

29:20.830 --> 29:21.860
This is Ascendance Sect.

29:22.200 --> 29:22.980
Let's go.

29:27.920 --> 29:29.660
I'm Wang Qi of Spiritkin Division,

29:29.790 --> 29:31.010
requesting to enter the formation.

29:31.270 --> 29:32.570
I'm Liu Sizhe of Spiritkin Division,

29:32.720 --> 29:33.810
requesting to enter the formation.

29:38.790 --> 29:39.570
Go on.

29:54.880 --> 29:55.940
Why are you still standing there?

29:55.960 --> 29:56.980
Go over there.

29:58.110 --> 29:58.660
That hurts!

29:58.680 --> 29:59.220
Let's go.

30:03.820 --> 30:06.640
♪Once a drifting weed, I loved to roam♪

30:06.640 --> 30:08.800
♪Now, a levee holds back the storm♪

30:09.260 --> 30:12.580
♪Fight against fate for my life♪

30:12.580 --> 30:15.190
♪Close eyes to sense the world♪

30:15.190 --> 30:17.530
♪Years splash ink♪

30:17.850 --> 30:20.030
♪Trekking far and wide♪

30:20.030 --> 30:23.100
♪Silent in subtleties♪

30:23.100 --> 30:25.760
♪The task descends on me♪

30:26.000 --> 30:31.440
♪Though millions block, it echoes loud♪

30:31.440 --> 30:33.530
Help! Help!

30:37.760 --> 30:38.470
♪Plain and unremarkable♪

30:38.750 --> 30:39.620
Help!

30:40.400 --> 30:41.700
♪If smooth, seek peace♪

30:42.720 --> 30:43.570
Help!

30:43.790 --> 30:44.730
Help!

30:45.850 --> 30:47.410
♪Mad ones, why ruin your foundation♪

30:47.410 --> 30:48.610
♪The evil knows no shame♪

30:48.610 --> 30:49.920
♪Immortal trials burn cowardice away♪

30:50.240 --> 30:51.010
Yunxiao!

30:51.140 --> 30:52.500
♪Gouging eyes to light the night
and ferry souls♪

30:52.590 --> 30:53.460
Did you have fun?

30:54.750 --> 30:55.530
Yes.

30:56.240 --> 30:57.420
Thank you for your help.

30:57.480 --> 30:59.290
That's why I manage with such ease.

30:59.500 --> 31:01.890
♪Today my name reaches heaven♪

31:01.890 --> 31:02.640
♪Actually, I've descended to the world♪

31:02.640 --> 31:03.330
Yunxiao,

31:03.550 --> 31:05.730
how do you know
Cloudlink Hermit's formation?

31:06.070 --> 31:07.140
I've passed it three times.

31:08.440 --> 31:09.810
You've been here?

31:10.110 --> 31:11.530
I think I took his Fiendscour Mirror

31:11.550 --> 31:12.530
and never gave it back.

31:14.350 --> 31:15.250
Turn right up ahead.

31:15.480 --> 31:15.980
All right.

31:16.570 --> 31:17.650
♪Charging against the wind♪

31:17.650 --> 31:19.170
♪Old scars reveal the truth♪

31:19.590 --> 31:20.180
Turn right?

31:20.440 --> 31:21.220
No way.

31:21.720 --> 31:22.730
I'd better evade.

31:23.110 --> 31:23.660
Evade.

31:23.660 --> 31:29.170
♪I temper a clear conscience♪

31:29.750 --> 31:30.290
Senior.

31:30.720 --> 31:36.140
♪I won't yield♪

31:36.830 --> 31:37.700
Even this formation

31:38.440 --> 31:40.530
can't reveal your true skill?

31:46.070 --> 31:47.330
Little Uncle!

31:48.680 --> 31:49.180
Girl.

31:49.200 --> 31:49.700
Senior.

31:56.110 --> 31:57.900
Your Highness, strike a pose.

31:59.200 --> 31:59.980
Pose?

32:00.310 --> 32:01.140
What do you mean?

32:02.070 --> 32:02.660
Well.

32:02.790 --> 32:03.730
Just strike a pose.

32:17.350 --> 32:19.330
Why are these swords circling me?

32:24.510 --> 32:25.860
The move I lent him

32:25.960 --> 32:27.460
should not be seen through, right?

32:27.790 --> 32:28.810
Junior Youqin,

32:30.030 --> 32:31.900
among our Three Sects,

32:32.070 --> 32:35.220
this rivalry and tense air

32:35.830 --> 32:36.860
is hardly good, is it?

32:36.880 --> 32:38.090
Yeah.

32:38.830 --> 32:40.220
We all cultivate the Way.

32:40.510 --> 32:41.940
We should help one another.

32:42.110 --> 32:43.770
Why fight to rank above others?

32:45.310 --> 32:46.090
Exactly.

32:47.720 --> 32:49.090
On the path of immortality,

32:49.160 --> 32:50.730
bonds always matter.

32:53.000 --> 32:53.980
Your words

32:54.240 --> 32:55.420
are truly worth savoring.

32:56.200 --> 32:57.570
I have an idea.

32:58.070 --> 33:00.180
It can raise Ascendance Sect's renown

33:00.200 --> 33:03.010
and turn Seizing Sect
from foe to friend.

33:03.310 --> 33:04.570
Senior, just give the word.

33:04.590 --> 33:07.530
I want you to step forth

33:07.680 --> 33:10.620
to challenge

33:10.640 --> 33:11.900
Cloudlink Hermit's formation.

33:20.030 --> 33:21.770
I want you to aid

33:21.830 --> 33:24.010
the Seizing cultivator.

33:24.240 --> 33:26.770
As you two work together,

33:26.960 --> 33:28.290
everyone will see

33:28.310 --> 33:30.730
that sects joining hands

33:30.830 --> 33:33.090
can wield far greater power.

33:34.200 --> 33:34.980
Well.

33:35.480 --> 33:37.730
To repel foes with you

33:38.070 --> 33:39.140
is my greatest honor.

33:40.480 --> 33:42.180
Your skills are truly remarkable.

33:42.270 --> 33:43.620
I'm deeply impressed.

33:44.830 --> 33:45.660
How formidable.

33:45.680 --> 33:46.420
Your disciple?

33:46.830 --> 33:47.700
I taught him.

33:47.830 --> 33:48.980
He has newly developed magic arts.

33:49.000 --> 33:49.220
Really?

33:49.240 --> 33:49.770
They're even more powerful.

33:49.790 --> 33:50.420
I don't believe it.

33:55.440 --> 33:58.730
Could Changgeng be one of these two?

34:02.160 --> 34:03.010
Where do we go next?

34:05.550 --> 34:06.380
Senior Changshou,

34:06.550 --> 34:07.620
we'll follow your lead.

34:07.920 --> 34:09.300
There's a mountain to your east.

34:09.400 --> 34:11.570
The treasure sits atop the peak.

34:11.960 --> 34:12.740
Alright.

34:13.150 --> 34:13.690
Sir,

34:14.000 --> 34:14.420
please.

34:32.030 --> 34:33.900
♪I don't ask, too lazy to fight♪

34:33.900 --> 34:35.980
♪I dare to live my own way♪

34:35.980 --> 34:38.500
♪In the Primordial World♪

34:38.500 --> 34:40.310
♪Who sings and drinks free♪

34:40.530 --> 34:42.650
♪The stars smile at fireflies♪

34:43.110 --> 34:44.740
Why do we get all the dirty work

34:45.000 --> 34:46.010
while he hides underground?

34:46.400 --> 34:47.650
He's always been like this.

34:48.360 --> 34:50.050
He does all the work himself,

34:50.320 --> 34:51.610
yet we get the credit.

34:51.880 --> 34:52.780
I see.

34:54.150 --> 34:55.610
Fame means nothing to me.

34:56.030 --> 34:57.860
I seek only the way of life.

34:58.230 --> 35:00.260
Break the formation together. Got it?

35:00.280 --> 35:00.900
Yes.

35:02.760 --> 35:03.340
I never thought

35:03.630 --> 35:05.050
this Seizing cultivator's technique

35:05.510 --> 35:07.820
is so similar to our ways.

35:08.840 --> 35:11.420
It seems all paths share one origin.

35:11.590 --> 35:13.300
I didn't know he was so powerful.

35:14.030 --> 35:15.170
Yesterday,

35:15.630 --> 35:16.780
was he going easy on me?

35:16.880 --> 35:18.610
Our clan may finally have hope.

35:18.920 --> 35:20.610
But I'm the senior.

35:21.030 --> 35:21.650
Right?

35:22.000 --> 35:22.460
Yes, yes.

35:23.630 --> 35:25.340
You don't think Little Uncle

35:25.360 --> 35:26.300
has fallen for her, right?

35:27.320 --> 35:28.420
No, no.

35:28.440 --> 35:30.300
Little Uncle is still a child, right?

35:33.480 --> 35:35.610
Can you do anything besides nodding?

35:39.590 --> 35:41.210
You think this can break my formation?

35:41.360 --> 35:43.530
You underestimate me.

35:43.710 --> 35:44.980
Soul Projection!

35:53.440 --> 35:54.010
Senior,

35:54.590 --> 35:55.650
we've reached the summit.

35:56.710 --> 35:58.690
Junior, block the demon beast

35:58.710 --> 36:00.010
and buy us some time.

36:00.030 --> 36:00.490
Understood.

36:03.920 --> 36:04.900
What are you standing there for?

36:05.030 --> 36:06.210
Hurry, find the treasure!

36:41.670 --> 36:42.420
Over there.

36:47.710 --> 36:48.490
Hey.

36:49.440 --> 36:50.380
I won't let you

36:50.710 --> 36:52.650
break the formation so easily.

37:20.710 --> 37:21.490
Come on.

37:22.230 --> 37:23.090
Face the formation trial!

37:24.510 --> 37:26.780
Who knew he'd cheat when losing?

37:28.150 --> 37:29.780
Changshou, what do we do now?

37:30.280 --> 37:30.900
Don't panic.

37:31.440 --> 37:33.460
If he can cheat, so can I.

37:39.110 --> 37:39.820
Where are you?

37:40.710 --> 37:42.090
Face the formation trial!

37:44.710 --> 37:45.490
What's going on?

37:46.230 --> 37:46.980
Changshou,

37:47.920 --> 37:49.090
weren't you going
to help me seize spiritual power?

37:49.440 --> 37:50.260
I'll keep my word.

37:50.920 --> 37:51.860
If we hide here,

37:52.920 --> 37:54.090
how do we get that pearl?

37:55.630 --> 37:58.940
Who says you need the pearl
for spiritual power?

37:58.960 --> 37:59.610
But...

38:01.710 --> 38:03.170
When painting,

38:03.360 --> 38:05.050
a cultivator will unconsciously infuse

38:05.070 --> 38:07.780
their cultivation insights into it,

38:07.800 --> 38:08.940
forming Resonance.

38:08.960 --> 38:10.820
Grasping Resonance can help you
draw spiritual power.

38:10.840 --> 38:12.820
So, the moment you entered,

38:12.960 --> 38:14.740
you were already drawing it in.

38:14.760 --> 38:15.980
I see.

38:16.400 --> 38:17.530
You had a plan.

38:18.920 --> 38:19.780
Close your eyes.

38:21.800 --> 38:23.130
Recall all the scenery

38:23.800 --> 38:27.170
you saw on the way.

38:27.190 --> 38:27.860
Wait.

38:28.840 --> 38:30.010
Why am I the only one comprehending?

38:30.230 --> 38:31.050
Why are you not?

38:33.110 --> 38:34.610
Because I am slow.

38:34.880 --> 38:36.380
And you are gifted.

38:37.840 --> 38:38.610
Fair enough.

38:42.920 --> 38:44.210
Think carefully.

38:44.480 --> 38:45.980
Try to comprehend

38:46.550 --> 38:48.260
the Resonance.

38:51.960 --> 38:53.300
The tables have turned.

38:53.400 --> 38:55.130
Cloudlink Hermit has played long enough.

38:55.400 --> 38:58.380
Time for me to tease him
with the formation.

39:02.070 --> 39:05.300
This kid knows what Resonance is for.

39:06.230 --> 39:08.090
A fine immortal seedling indeed.

39:14.960 --> 39:15.530
This is...

39:16.110 --> 39:16.740
This is...

39:20.070 --> 39:22.860
He saw me use Mountain-Moving

39:22.880 --> 39:23.490
and figured out

39:23.510 --> 39:25.610
the secret of my Ream Landscape.

39:25.960 --> 39:26.740
Good.

39:27.760 --> 39:29.650
He even means to trap me.

39:30.400 --> 39:30.980
Good.

39:31.670 --> 39:33.090
I drew this landscape myself.

39:33.360 --> 39:34.980
How could I not break out?

39:49.840 --> 39:50.980
So, this is the Mortal Realm?

39:51.880 --> 39:52.820
Indeed it is.

39:53.280 --> 39:54.570
The Mortal Realm is perilous.

39:55.110 --> 39:56.340
I must find Changgeng the Great

39:56.360 --> 39:57.210
and take him as my mentor.

39:57.230 --> 39:57.860
Wait.

39:58.320 --> 40:00.130
Is learning from Changgeng so vital?

40:00.280 --> 40:01.130
Of course, it is.

40:01.150 --> 40:03.050
Only Changgeng the Great can train me,

40:03.070 --> 40:04.610
so I can revive the Dragon Clan.

40:07.230 --> 40:07.980
Answer me:

40:08.190 --> 40:09.570
What good is strength?

40:09.590 --> 40:10.340
The Dragon Clan used to be mighty,

40:10.360 --> 40:12.210
but now, it's weakened.

40:12.230 --> 40:13.610
The Demon Emperor swept
the Three Realms,

40:13.630 --> 40:15.300
yet he was defeated and met death.

40:16.880 --> 40:17.690
Listen.

40:17.710 --> 40:18.610
No matter how strong you are,

40:18.630 --> 40:20.260
you cannot stand alone

40:20.280 --> 40:21.610
against the whole world.

40:21.630 --> 40:22.780
A true powerhouse

40:22.800 --> 40:24.420
is not strong in themselves,

40:24.670 --> 40:25.820
but in the people's hearts.

40:26.440 --> 40:27.170
The people's hearts?

40:27.190 --> 40:29.010
If you want to be Dragon Clan's light,

40:29.030 --> 40:31.610
you don't need a mentor.

40:32.000 --> 40:33.420
You need to be a leader

40:33.440 --> 40:34.570
who can win over

40:34.590 --> 40:36.740
the whole Dragon Clan.

40:36.840 --> 40:37.530
Remember:

40:37.550 --> 40:39.820
Without hearts, might is useless.

40:39.840 --> 40:42.340
One who wins people's hearts is a hero.

40:44.590 --> 40:45.460
People's hearts?

40:46.190 --> 40:47.460
What if I lack people's hearts?

40:47.760 --> 40:48.780
Will a dragon's heart do?

41:00.320 --> 41:02.210
He has exceptional comprehension,

41:02.590 --> 41:04.690
but his aesthetic sense is awful.

41:15.840 --> 41:16.980
What kind

41:18.190 --> 41:19.420
of brutal cultivation

41:19.840 --> 41:21.860
has he endured?

41:43.110 --> 41:45.340
I gathered many herbs

41:45.360 --> 41:46.980
to make a custom sachet for you.

41:48.030 --> 41:49.980
Take it out and sniff it now and then.

41:50.000 --> 41:51.900
Perhaps one day,
your sense of smell will come back.

41:58.030 --> 41:59.260
Where did you get this sachet?

42:01.000 --> 42:01.940
I was...

42:02.630 --> 42:03.420
I...

42:04.880 --> 42:06.530
Since I ran into that old rogue,

42:07.110 --> 42:08.090
my sense of smell was gone.

42:11.710 --> 42:12.490
My condolences.

42:12.670 --> 42:13.460
No need, no need.

42:13.670 --> 42:14.570
Senior can cure this.

42:17.190 --> 42:18.210
Senior gave me this sachet.

42:18.230 --> 42:19.210
She told me to keep it on me

42:19.360 --> 42:20.980
and sniff it now and then.

42:21.000 --> 42:22.300
Then, my sense of smell would return.

42:25.840 --> 42:26.940
Has it come back?

42:27.190 --> 42:27.980
Not at all.

42:29.190 --> 42:30.780
But when I smell this,

42:31.110 --> 42:32.460
I can faintly catch a scent.

42:36.840 --> 42:38.010
What did you smell?

42:38.400 --> 42:39.170
I smelled

42:39.320 --> 42:40.530
that Changgeng the Great is
in Ascendance Sect.

42:40.550 --> 42:41.820
I must take him as my mentor.

42:59.280 --> 43:00.650
Here he is.

43:00.880 --> 43:03.380
Though I don't know

43:03.400 --> 43:04.900
Changgeng's true face,

43:04.920 --> 43:06.980
as long as Changgeng is here,

43:08.630 --> 43:10.010
the Pregenesis Sword

43:10.480 --> 43:12.170
must be right here.

43:15.800 --> 43:16.650
Elder Kuai,

43:17.230 --> 43:19.050
it is time.

43:53.030 --> 43:58.810
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

43:59.480 --> 44:06.180
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

44:07.710 --> 44:13.760
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

44:14.390 --> 44:20.840
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

44:21.580 --> 44:28.700
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

44:29.080 --> 44:35.980
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

44:36.360 --> 44:43.710
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

44:43.710 --> 44:50.880
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

45:07.020 --> 45:12.190
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

45:13.280 --> 45:20.300
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

45:21.490 --> 45:27.430
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

45:28.130 --> 45:35.210
♪Alas, our story is short♪

45:35.550 --> 45:42.660
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

45:42.980 --> 45:49.460
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

45:50.240 --> 45:57.450
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

45:57.840 --> 46:05.660
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
